hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Apni khala Maimunah [Raziyallahu anha] ki raat mein raat bhar thehre. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur latki hui mashk se wuzu farmaya. Ravi kehte hain: Phir unhon ne Aap ke wuzu ka bayan kiya, aur use apne hath se kam [pani wala] banaya. Phir Ibn Abbas khade hue aur waisa hi kiya jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kiya tha. Ravi kehte hain: Phir main aaya aur Aap ke baen taraf khada hua. To Aap ne mujhe peeche se le kar apne dayen taraf kar diya, phir namaz padhi. Phir Aap let gae aur so gae yahan tak ke kharrate lene lage. Phir Bilal aae aur Aap ko Subah [ki namaz] ki khabar di. To Aap ne namaz padhi aur wuzu nahin farmaya. Sufyan kehte hain: Kyunke ham tak pahuncha hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aankhen soti thin aur Aap ka dil nahin sota tha."
"56","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne aur hamare ek yateem ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche hamare ghar mein namaz padhi, aur Umm Sulaim hamare peeche [khadin thin]."
"57","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne use khabar di ke woh Maimunah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja ke paas raat bhar thehre, jo un ki khala thin. Unhon ne kaha: Main takiye ki chaudai mein let gaya, 'Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ki ahliya us ki lambai mein lete. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) so gae, yahan tak ke jab aadhi raat hui ya us se thoda pehle ya ba'd, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jage. Aap baith gae aur Apne dono hathon se chehre se neend ponchhne lage, phir Surah Aal Imran ki aakhri das aayaten padhin, phir latki hui mashk ki taraf khade hue, to us se wuzu farmaya aur Apna wuzu khoob farmaya, phir khade ho kar namaz padhne lage.' Abdullah bin Abbas kehte hain: To main khada hua aur waisa hi kiya jaisa Aap ne kiya, phir gaya aur Aap ke pahlun mein khada hua. 'To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Apna dayan hath mere sar par rakha, aur mere kaan ko pakad kar use maroda [pyar se]; phir Aap ne do rak'aten padhin, phir do rak'aten, phir do rak'aten, phir do rak'aten, phir do rak'aten, phir do rak'aten, phir witr padha. Phir let gae yahan tak ke muazzin Aap ke paas aaya. To Aap khade hue aur do halki rak'aten [sunnat Fajr] padhin, phir nikle aur [Fajr ki] namaz padhai.'"
"58","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un ki dadi Mulaikah [Raziyallahu anha] ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us khane ki dawat di jo unhon ne banaya tha. To Aap ne us mein se khaya, phir farmaya: 'Khade ho jao, main tumhen namaz padhaon.' Anas kehte hain: To main hamari ek chatai ki taraf khada hua jo lambe istemal se siyah ho chuki thi, aur main ne us par pani chhidka. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us par khade hue; main aur yateem Aap ke peeche saf bandhe, aur budhiya hamare peeche. To Aap ne ham ko do rak'aten padhain, phir wapas gae Sallallahu alaihi wasallam."
